@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Multi-step calculator stream
POST {{baseUrl}}/query/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Calculate 17 * 23, then calculate 144 / 12",
  "session_id": "http-file-calc-test"
}

### Search tool followed by a model response
POST {{baseUrl}}/query/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "check what kind of abilities does the Agent Starter have, then summarize the results in no more than 300 characters",
  "session_id": "agent-starter-ability"
}

### Submit background tasks
# @name submitTasks
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompts": [
    "Calculate 17 * 23",
    "Calculate 144 / 12"
  ],
  "session_id": "http-file-tasks-test"
}

### Get task status and results
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{submitTasks.response.body.$.task_id}}
